# Local API diagnostic captures — never commit.
#
# SenSource carries org names, addresses and MACs. Resi carries encoder and
# destination names, which are the room and the platform you stream to. Neither
# holds a credential by construction, and neither belongs in the history.
sensource-capture*.json
sensource-probe*.json
resi-capture*.json
resi-probe*.json

# Local tooling scratch (Playwright MCP screenshots/logs, impeccable design plugin)
.playwright-mcp/
.impeccable/

# Internal working documents. These are notes to ourselves — proposals with a
# "decisions for you" section, and references to local tooling paths that exist
# on no other machine.
#
# docs/superpowers/ was here and is now TRACKED again: the specs and plans are
# how a change was decided and how it was carried out, and a reviewer reading a
# PR should be able to read the plan it implements. They keep their task
# checkboxes and their agent directive header; that is what they are.
docs/design-overhaul/
DESIGN_TOKENS_PROPOSAL.md
scripts/survival/.survival-*.log

# Playwright screenshots taken while driving the app during development.
*.playwright.png
.playwright-mcp/
